comments.body:
@svirito4ka Has this been resolved?
If yes, can we close this?

If not, can you use paragraphs to give the reader some breaks?  It's hard to read a single paragraph that is so long.  Not everyone is going to do it.  

So, to get your point across, I suggest you help the reader by:

summarizing and eliminating what can be removed without leaving the important matters out;
and by grouping the content into paragraphs to make it easier to read..
